<!--
  Loaded only when the IDE provides the `com.intellij.modules.jcef` plugin (IntelliJ 2026.2 / build
  262 and later, where JCEF was extracted from the core platform into its own bundled plugin).

  It intentionally registers nothing. Its sole purpose is to give the optional <depends> in
  plugin.xml a config file, which makes the platform add the JCEF classloader to this plugin's
  parent classloaders so that com.intellij.ui.jcef.JBCefApp resolves. On IDEs where JCEF is still
  part of the core platform the dependency is simply not resolved and nothing changes.
-->
<idea-plugin>
</idea-plugin>
